<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Weight-only PTQ on Qwen3 models with 3-bit and 4-bit quantization, reporting perplexity and actual memory usage (GB). Lower is better for all metrics.
The best result for a given setting is marked in <span id="S3.T5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, the <em id="S3.T5.6" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">calibration-free</em> results that outperform all calibrated baselines at equal bits (other than our own) are marked <span id="S3.T5.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span>.
